# Idea: Fuel Recollectation

**Date:** 2026-02-14

## Description
What is the core idea?
Make the robot just focus on recollecting fuel during the autonomous period until it cannot take anymore or until we move onto the teleoperated mode 

## Potential Benefits
Why is this idea worth considering?
It allows the robot to be filled up, and unless there is code to make it shoot autonomously, during the teleoperated period we can control how and where
it shoots better. If we shoot in autonomous well gain the same points as we would if we shoot in teleoperated mode, so it is better to have a for sure way 
to get points instead of risking malfunction on hardware’s or software’s part during autonomous mode

## Considerations
What would be needed to implement this?
code that would indicate the robot to only recollect fuel during the first 20 seconds of autonomous period. 


